  "stem": "The number of households using biogas units in a district of Sindh, Pakistan, is modeled by \\(N(t) = 350(2)^{\\frac{t}{6}}\\), where \\(t\\) is the number of years after 2020. According to the model, in what year will 2,800 households be using biogas units?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "2038"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Set \\(350(2)^{\\frac{t}{6}} = 2{,}800\\), so \\(2^{\\frac{t}{6}} = 8 = 2^{3}\\).",
    "Then \\(\\frac{t}{6} = 3\\), so \\(t = 18\\).",
    "18 years after 2020 is 2038."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "t = symbols('t', real=True)\ns = solve(Eq(350*2**(t/6), 2800), t)\nassert s == [18]\nassert int(spr_answers[0]) == 2020 + s[0]",
